<!DOCTYPE html>
<html><head><title>Welcome</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"><font><span>Welcome to the TRAIL! If you have ever felt like there is a gap between your studies and the real world, transdisciplinary education is here to bridge that gap. By walking the  <b>TRAIL</b>, you will better understand transdisciplinary education and gain tips and tricks for collaborating with teachers, fellow students, researchers, and external partners.</span></font></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"><span><font><span>This TRAIL sets you on the path to tackling significant societal issues and working with people from entirely </span> <span>different backgrounds</span><span>.</span></font></span></p></body></html>